# Repo-root builds (infra/pilot/Dockerfile, context = repo root) ship ONLY:
# sdk/, server/webclient/ (manifest + src), and bots/quests/.
# Everything else is excluded to keep the context small — and so secrets
# (bots/*/bot.env) can NEVER bake into an image layer.
.git/
.cursor/session-notes/
.github/
**/node_modules/
server/engine/
server/gateway/
server/content/
server/webclient/out/
bots/*/bot.env
**/*.log
**/*.sqlite*
**/.DS_Store
